        <Param val="Welcome!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this experiment, you will see a series of five arrows.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Your task is to respond to the direction of the MIDDLE arrow.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Use the LEFT arrow key when the middle arrow points left.&amp;#10;Use the RIGHT arrow key when the middle arrow points right.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Try to respond as quickly and accurately as possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to continue." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
